    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss, Penguin Logistics is on the move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I just gave her a few skin deep cuts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm more worried about Capone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Y- yeah, we haven't been able to reach him. Tried real hard an hour ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the last place you got him? The slums?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's too bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell all the crews, we're going with the original plan to get Penguin Logistics...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm thinkin'... unless something goes wrong, we'll get two or three crews dropping off the grid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean... boss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't be... Capone betrayed the Family?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I get where he's comin' from. All too well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "We grew up together. And dad had us deal with a traitor, with our own two hands. That was my first time takin' a life. Our first time takin' a life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Siracusa fiasco changed us. The only difference is he turned weak, and I chose the clear path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's gonna sell out the Family. Or I guess he wants to give the Family a new name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what should we do about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics is turning out trickier than I thought. And we can't fight a war on too many fronts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinkin' we deal with our traitor problem first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm down at the intersection. Nothing special here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger. Proceed as usual.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "W- wait! What's the plan here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You screwed up something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I just wanna be sure. I really don't know Lungmen at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Sauin. When midnight rolls around, Lungmen kicks off a huge Carnival. The whole town turns out. That's when we rub out Penguin Logistics. Bada bing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now about the boss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't ask too many questions. Just do what you're told. Chop-chop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "...it's what it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ain't gonna kill me, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not. But you gotta take a nap for me like a good boy~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas, you copy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
