        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the same over here. They all split off into little groups.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "But their leader was in the fight himself, which means they've got someone else handing out dispatch orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just have to cut off that head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey~ Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in the city center, but boy are there a lot of people out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch for the enemy. They're moving in small teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know~ We'll make sure our friends on the street keep an eye out... Wait, boss? You want to get up on a float? Erm, wait for me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Croissant, Bison, do you copy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you were talking about that someone else giving dispatch orders, we ran into a little surprise over here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bison, get down. Take cover behind that box over there. Don't get yerself seen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. I'll call you back, Texas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "So where do we go from here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I dunno. Since we cut off the boss... since we cut off Gambino Ricci, we really don't have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's to sigh about? Mr. Capone did so much for us here in Lungmen, and what came of it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gambino hops on over from Siracusa and makes nothin' but trouble. Not a lick of good's come of him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we kept to Mr. Capone's plan from the start, we wouldn't be in this mess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been over this with the Rat King. Why do we gotta kill anybody? This ain't Siracusa!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The boss, I mean the old boss, he's probably just blowin' off steam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well he needs to grow up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
