    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chasing_intro",
        "key": "$chasing_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? A gunshot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's that sniper again! We're exposed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the Penguins! Don't let 'em get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_029#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do forgive me, Young Master. This is what the Master of the House has demanded of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in taking action upon the Young Master, I have placed him in danger...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "text": "When this matter is concluded, I believe it may be time to retire to the countryside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sounds like they're in trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai, once you've marked out the gangsters' route, move to meet up with Croissant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got it~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sora.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whew... the bad guys are making a lot of moves, but it looks like they're splitting into two teams. Might be a trap...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not so complicated. The enemy is suffering from internal strife. This is an opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yith"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaie! You scared me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Welcome back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why'd you have to hack into our private channel? Couldn't you just send us a normal message?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was quicker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yith"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "A depressing cafe. I suddenly remembered I was supposed to have today off, so I came out to enjoy the nightlife.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yith"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've sent you Croissant and the new boy's coordinates. Lungmen's network speeds are remarkably satisfactory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yith"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...understood. Once we've finished our respective missions, we'll move to assist them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is our chance to strike back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
