    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Capone, the boss's hit on Penguin Logistics looks like it failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that meathead worth? I don't even wanna hear his name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is that how we do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Family needs a solid foundation. The name is the least important part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you find the Rat King yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not yet. He really don't leave any tracks around...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We gotta be patient. He's like a part of the city. He's Lungmen's shadow. It ain't like we got much time though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But we gotta be careful. If the Rat King picks up on what we're doin', we could find ourselves fighting three sides at once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the same for everyone. If we're locked into a tough spot, the best thing to do is stir up some chaos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got news of Gambino?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You deaf?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you got somethin' to say to me, shouldn't you just say it to my face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you get in here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not everybody's like you. Not everybody can just up and turn their back on an oath made before dad's grave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oath? That's just because we were walking the same path. But times have changed, Gambino.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You broke my heart, Capone. But I'll give you one last chance to explain yourself, as my brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Seven years ago, when we buried the old boss, you sent me here, to Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "I came halfway across the world to set up a business that could support the Family, like a backstop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then you had to go and screw up in Siracusa. And what do you do? You hop on over here and take over everything I broke my back to build.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, you ain't gettin' pissed off over some little shit like this. Or you'd've been dead a long time ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Say what you want. But today I learned the sharpest fangs in the Family's what's gonna turn around and kill it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you gonna pull out your fangs and snap a collar on yourself? Hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep runnin' around Lungmen makin' noise like you do, sooner or later the powers that be are gonna get sick of it and wipe us out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your deep and heartfelt concern for the Family is moving me to tears, dear Capone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The feeling's mutual.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
